id: pm-rl-meta-gate
title: Reconcile inherited release-test expectations with native refusal contracts
description: Three test/meta.test.ts failures reproduce on untouched cd91de9 with coverage enabled. The two-generation replay and pre-approved Decision cases expect an old disagrees message but now receive typed meta_reservation_drift. The programme case-folding case expects UPPER to reach a callback but receives meta_programme_id. Reconcile the intended compatibility and refusal contracts without weakening native peer conflict protection or valid historical reads. These failures are outside the seven PR 107 review fixes.
type: Task
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags[1]: "gh:unbraind/pm-rl#107"
